  "title": "Region 32 Dispatch | June 02, 2026",
  "subtitle": "Coordination of Survey Logistics",
  "main_story": {
    "headline": "Logistical Clarification for the Survey Team",
    "lede": "Local communications focused on determining the specific departure timing and current location of the survey team.",
    "body": "Discussions regarding the movement of the survey team centered on their pending transition from *Reed Camp*. **Wren** stated that the group plans to leave following the *second bell*.\n\nThis statement prompted a query from **Xara** concerning whether the instruction refers to the noon or evening period. To resolve this ambiguity, it was established that **Yori** will provide the confirmed departure time in an upcoming update."
  }
}

